Package: deepseek-harness-web
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), ca-certificates
Recommends: xdg-utils, libnotify-bin
Installed-Size: __SIZE_KB__
Maintainer: local build <local@localhost>
Description: DeepSeek Harness Web UI and CLI (self-contained)
 Bundles the built Web frontend, the CLI runtime tree and Node 24.
 A desktop launcher is installed: search "DeepSeek Harness" in the
 application menu to start the service and open it in a browser.
 Alternatively run 'dsh-web start', then 'dsh-web url'.
 The service listens on 127.0.0.1:3080 and requires the startup token.
